WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.416 --> 00:00:07.583
I can’t wait to move into Gridiron Heights!

00:00:07.791 --> 00:00:10.625
You guys are all f--king mistakes.

00:00:10.916 --> 00:00:12.583
We’re here! Starters first!

00:00:15.916 --> 00:00:18.291
KNEEL BEFORE ME, ROOKIE SCUM!

00:00:18.291 --> 00:00:19.041
Nick!

00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:20.791
Buddy, you know I’m coming back.

00:00:20.791 --> 00:00:23.791
Ok, well, thanks, everyone. This was SO much fun while it lasted.

00:00:26.666 --> 00:00:29.750
Gridiron Heights has never been stronger.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.375
Rebuilding is so fun.

00:00:33.416 --> 00:00:34.666
Helmet to helmet!

00:00:34.666 --> 00:00:36.125
Yeah, we’re not rebuilding.

00:00:36.125 --> 00:00:36.958
Yes you are.

00:00:36.958 --> 00:00:39.916
I can clearly see you restructuring everything.

00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:41.000
Yeah, no. Nothing’s changed.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.125
We’re still really good.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:43.958
Jimmy, are you going to help me?

00:00:43.958 --> 00:00:46.000
Nah, just build around me.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:48.500
Finally! Our rebuild is over.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:50.416
Hey! I’m not hurt this time!

00:00:50.416 --> 00:00:51.958
Soon enough, Sammy.

00:00:52.166 --> 00:00:53.458
Just hit the nail, Hue.

00:00:53.458 --> 00:00:56.208
The nail may not get hammered....

00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:59.166
...but Browns fans certainly will.

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:01.208
The Patriots do not rebuild...

00:01:01.250 --> 00:01:03.000
We reload.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Um, Coach, are we cool?

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:05.666
No.

00:01:10.791 --> 00:01:13.166
Coach, ​t​hese plays are from before they invented the forward pass.

00:01:13.166 --> 00:01:15.125
Why is every guy on our team 40 years old?

00:01:15.125 --> 00:01:18.541
I'll tell you what man, you modern players with your personal brands and your screen passes.

00:01:18.541 --> 00:01:21.666
Sometimes I wish I could just go back in time, man. Ooo-

00:01:21.708 --> 00:01:24.000
Thanks for paying for the time machine instead of Khalil Mack.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:26.375
Oh, of course, Jonnie! I love chasing the past!

00:01:26.375 --> 00:01:29.625
Bring me back to when football was football and men were men, man.

00:01:29.666 --> 00:01:30.791
2002!

00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:35.416
Same office, same haircut

00:01:35.416 --> 00:01:36.791
Wait... I know you man.

00:01:36.791 --> 00:01:39.000
Coach, it’s me, Rich Gannon.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.333
I tell yah what, a reliable quarterback I don’t have to pay...

00:01:41.333 --> 00:01:42.625
I went back in time, man!

00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:43.958
Hey, Coach Gruden!

00:01:43.958 --> 00:01:45.125
Clean tackle!

00:01:45.125 --> 00:01:48.625
Can’t wait to practice all offseason with no restrictions!

00:01:48.666 --> 00:01:49.583
I am in heaven!

00:01:49.583 --> 00:01:51.916
Oh hi, Coach! Have you met our terrible backup yet?

00:01:51.916 --> 00:01:53.208
Hello. I’m Thomas-

00:01:53.208 --> 00:01:53.875
Whoops!

00:01:53.875 --> 00:01:56.666
Hahaha, thank goodness for the Tuck Rule.

00:01:56.666 --> 00:01:59.166
Even clumsy rookie idiots can drop the ball...

00:01:59.166 --> 00:01:59.916
and it’s still not a fumble!

00:01:59.916 --> 00:02:00.916
and it’s still not a fumble!

00:02:00.916 --> 00:02:03.125
MARK, YOU GOT TO BRING ME BACK TO 2018, MAN!

00:02:03.125 --> 00:02:04.958
Tight Ends who block, Shrek, commit to the run game...

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.958
I’m sorry: But his brain is trapped in 2002.

00:02:08.416 --> 00:02:09.125
FOREVER!

00:02:09.166 --> 00:02:10.708
And that’s the Raider way!

00:02:15.833 --> 00:02:17.291
Mike, please don’t leave me here, bro.

00:02:17.291 --> 00:02:18.625
Tellus, you’re retired.

00:02:18.625 --> 00:02:20.333
It’s not safe for you to be on your own.

00:02:20.333 --> 00:02:21.416
I’m a year younger than you.

00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:22.416
I’ll come visit...

00:02:22.416 --> 00:02:24.125
Maybe during my bye week.

00:02:24.125 --> 00:02:25.791
That’s not till Week 9...

00:02:25.791 --> 00:02:27.166
Brothers never visit.

00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:30.958
So it’s pretty neat here.

00:02:30.958 --> 00:02:33.291
You can help the retired Cowboys call bingo games.

00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:35.375
Ok, so based on this formation...

00:02:35.375 --> 00:02:37.916
I’m guessing the next ball will be N24.

00:02:37.916 --> 00:02:38.875
What he said!

00:02:38.875 --> 00:02:40.291
Um...hey, Witt.

00:02:40.291 --> 00:02:41.000
Oh...

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:41.875
It’s Marty.

00:02:42.166 --> 00:02:44.000
When I moved into the retirement home...

00:02:44.000 --> 00:02:45.666
crime dropped 100 percent!

00:02:45.666 --> 00:02:47.833
Here we see our exercise programs.

00:02:47.833 --> 00:02:49.541
My in-season record is 25,000...

00:02:49.541 --> 00:02:50.750
but I think I can beat that now!

00:02:50.875 --> 00:02:52.666
I’m sure Canada will call soon, T.O.!

00:02:52.666 --> 00:02:54.291
They still think they can play...

00:02:54.291 --> 00:02:55.833
This place sucks.

00:02:55.833 --> 00:02:57.500
I gotta get the f--k out of here.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.125
Martellus, you’re 31.

00:02:59.125 --> 00:03:01.291
There’s nothing out there for you anymore.

00:03:01.291 --> 00:03:01.958
One of us... One of us...

00:03:01.958 --> 00:03:03.833
I survived a 28-3 deficit—

00:03:03.833 --> 00:03:05.583
I’m not going out like this!

00:03:06.791 --> 00:03:09.291
Cutty, I need help!

00:03:09.291 --> 00:03:09.958
Cigarette?

00:03:09.958 --> 00:03:12.000
There we go miscommunicating again.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:12.750
AHHHHHH!!

00:03:12.750 --> 00:03:15.708
♪ Retired Athletes Have No Life. ♪

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:23.916
I’ve assembled the greatest con men in the NFL

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.500
Do just well enough to get the money

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:27.125
then your talent disappears

00:03:27.125 --> 00:03:28.750
But Fitzy, you’ve stolen millions

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:30.916
from the Rams, Bengals, Bills, Titans, Texans, Jets

00:03:30.916 --> 00:03:31.875
What else is there?

00:03:31.875 --> 00:03:34.625
I’m going to steal the starting QB job for the Bucs

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:38.166
Here’s the plan

00:03:38.166 --> 00:03:40.125
I cause a distraction in the media

00:03:40.125 --> 00:03:40.750
Ahem-

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:42.000
I went to Harvard

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:43.875
but I’m wearing silly clothes

00:03:43.875 --> 00:03:44.666
Wow! Look!

00:03:44.666 --> 00:03:46.666
Next we need a QB controversy

00:03:46.666 --> 00:03:48.500
That’s where Sammy Sleeves comes in

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:49.125
Whoops

00:03:49.125 --> 00:03:50.916
maybe you should start the rookie!

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.125
Dalton, Marvin

00:03:52.125 --> 00:03:53.500
I need you to get people excited

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.375
but still lose a Wild Card game

00:03:55.625 --> 00:03:57.250
The AFC North is really up for grabs

00:03:57.250 --> 00:03:57.875
At this point

00:03:57.875 --> 00:04:00.291
no one will know what it takes to be an NFL quarterback

00:04:00.291 --> 00:04:03.750
And if I play one good half, I’ll get the job

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:05.750
Now eventually, I'll be exposed

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:06.375
Uh, sir

00:04:06.375 --> 00:04:07.375
you’re going to want to see this

00:04:07.375 --> 00:04:08.750
Only I get to be overpaid

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:09.166
Get him!

00:04:09.166 --> 00:04:09.916
Tannehill

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:11.750
that’s when you confuse everybody

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:12.541
Uhhhhhhhh-

00:04:12.541 --> 00:04:14.041
they are 3-0 uhhh

00:04:14.041 --> 00:04:15.625
And they’ll have to start me anyway

00:04:15.625 --> 00:04:16.500
Any questions?

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:18.541
Why don’t we just play great football all the time?

00:04:18.541 --> 00:04:20.750
Because that’s so hard

00:04:25.750 --> 00:04:26.750
WOOHOO!!!!

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.375
Hey, Aaron, is it just me, or

00:04:28.375 --> 00:04:30.000
is this year’s Quarter-Season Carnival…

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.041
kinda soft?

00:04:31.041 --> 00:04:32.041
Sir, you’re going to have to leave

00:04:32.041 --> 00:04:32.541
Noooo

00:04:32.541 --> 00:04:33.541
I love quarterbacks

00:04:33.541 --> 00:04:34.375
I’m sorry

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:37.750
Hey look, guys

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:38.750
I finally hit the target!

00:04:38.750 --> 00:04:39.875
I’m sorry

00:04:39.875 --> 00:04:41.500
I know everyone’s rooting for me

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:42.125
Don’t worry

00:04:42.125 --> 00:04:43.416
The Colts will help you win!

00:04:43.416 --> 00:04:44.875
OH, I’M PATTY MAHOMES

00:04:44.875 --> 00:04:46.500
AND I SHOOT REAL GOOD

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:49.500
Come ride Booger McFarland’s Sideline Machine!

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:50.791
WELL, THE CONDITIONS HERE

00:04:50.791 --> 00:04:52.250
AT THE CARNIVAL ARE VERY SCARY

00:04:53.041 --> 00:04:54.000
Sir, you’re up

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.000
Nope. Not yet.

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:56.375
Man, where’s Eli?

00:04:56.375 --> 00:04:57.791
He said he’d connect with us here

00:04:57.791 --> 00:04:59.291
HELP! I’M NOT A MOBILE QB!

00:04:59.291 --> 00:05:00.625
I’M OLD AND SCARED

00:05:00.625 --> 00:05:01.375
God damn-

00:05:01.375 --> 00:05:04.166
Odell, you’re polite now, remember?

00:05:04.166 --> 00:05:05.625
I love dealing with Eli

00:05:05.625 --> 00:05:06.666
I can’t move my feet!

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:08.666
ELI! WHERE ARE YOU?!

00:05:08.666 --> 00:05:10.791
I won’t leave my corn pocket

00:05:10.791 --> 00:05:11.625
A PASS-RUSHER

00:05:11.625 --> 00:05:13.041
LOOKING FOR A PASS-RUSHER!

00:05:13.041 --> 00:05:13.916
ANY QUARTERBACKS!

00:05:13.916 --> 00:05:15.000
I’M LOOKING FOR ANY

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.875
NON-CONTROVERSIAL QUARTERBACKS!

00:05:16.875 --> 00:05:18.041
ANYBODY ON THE STEELERS!

00:05:18.041 --> 00:05:18.791
WHERE YOU AT!

00:05:18.791 --> 00:05:19.666
Shhhhhhh

00:05:19.666 --> 00:05:20.750
Don’t tell

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:22.125
No siree, Bob

00:05:22.125 --> 00:05:24.166
that maze is too tricky for me!

00:05:24.166 --> 00:05:25.750
WOW, WHAT A FUN, EASY MAZE

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:32.500
After a loss, do you ever feel...

00:05:32.500 --> 00:05:33.416
invisible?

00:05:33.416 --> 00:05:34.041
No

00:05:34.041 --> 00:05:35.625
mostly because people are always

00:05:35.625 --> 00:05:36.875
extremely mean to me

00:05:36.916 --> 00:05:37.750
I was like yo

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:38.916
I’ll never grab that ring

00:05:38.916 --> 00:05:39.416
but my God

00:05:39.416 --> 00:05:40.500
have you seen my STATS?

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:41.750
Whoa, pros only

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:42.625
Remember...

00:05:42.625 --> 00:05:43.500
the Titans?

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:45.291
Oh yeah…that’s right, the Titans

00:05:45.291 --> 00:05:46.250
I forgot about them

00:05:46.375 --> 00:05:47.125
We lost to the Bills

00:05:47.125 --> 00:05:48.750
and nobody knows we exist

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:50.125
Yeah, we should be household names

00:05:50.125 --> 00:05:51.125
right Corey Davis?

00:05:51.125 --> 00:05:52.125
Correct, Derrick Henry

00:05:52.125 --> 00:05:53.750
We need a makeover for the

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:55.500
Gridiron Heights homecoming dance

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.041
I heard you’re looking for a culture change

00:05:57.041 --> 00:05:58.750
Well, I used to play linebacker

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:00.041
WHOAAAA. SO RELATABLE.

00:06:02.625 --> 00:06:03.791
First, we’re gonna touch you guys up

00:06:03.791 --> 00:06:05.375
with some underperforming Patriots

00:06:05.375 --> 00:06:07.250
Next, we’ll give you a whole new look

00:06:07.250 --> 00:06:09.166
Wow! Two-tone gray sleeves!

00:06:09.166 --> 00:06:09.750
Lastly…

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.041
it’s all in the attitude

00:06:11.041 --> 00:06:11.500
Here

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:13.375
We go for it on 4th down now

00:06:13.375 --> 00:06:14.875
So we’re basically the same team-

00:06:14.875 --> 00:06:17.125
-That fired our coach after winning a playoff game

00:06:17.125 --> 00:06:18.750
-And made slight roster changes

00:06:18.750 --> 00:06:19.875
We’re beautiful!

00:06:19.875 --> 00:06:21.000
Where are the Titans?

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.125
I need them to beat me one more time this year

00:06:23.125 --> 00:06:24.125
Hi…

00:06:24.125 --> 00:06:25.500
Look at those unis

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:25.875
Whoa

00:06:25.875 --> 00:06:27.416
that’s a true big-market team

00:06:27.416 --> 00:06:28.875
if I’ve ever seen one

00:06:28.875 --> 00:06:30.750
Wow, the Rams got hot over the summer

00:06:44.208 --> 00:06:45.708
Odell said I’m a murderer?

00:06:45.708 --> 00:06:48.583
Haha, well that’s just our relationship, you know?

00:06:51.708 --> 00:06:52.750
I mean, it’s not like

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.875
you can draft a QB over Saquon!

00:06:54.875 --> 00:06:56.500
Yeah, I think they probably should have

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:57.875
Look, I love the fans

00:06:57.875 --> 00:06:59.125
I would never harm a fan

00:06:59.125 --> 00:07:00.375
But do I think they protect Eli?

00:07:00.375 --> 00:07:02.333
YEAH, WELL HOW MANY RINGS HAS ODELL GIVEN US?

00:07:02.333 --> 00:07:04.500
Eli won two Super Bowls against us

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:07.375
So now they are stuck with him forever

00:07:07.375 --> 00:07:10.000
Rumors are, there’s tension

00:07:10.000 --> 00:07:13.000
Eli, can you pass more to your best receiver?

00:07:13.000 --> 00:07:15.208
No. We must only checkdown.

00:07:15.208 --> 00:07:16.958
No comment! No comment!

00:07:16.958 --> 00:07:18.500
But yes, I am loving this

00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:19.833
BEN, GET OVER HERE

00:07:19.833 --> 00:07:21.250
YOU WON’T BELIEVE WHAT GRUDEN DID NOW

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:22.500
Yeah, we don’t even need to be good

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:23.625
to win this division anymore

00:07:23.625 --> 00:07:25.958
Look, I barely killed the Giants!

00:07:25.958 --> 00:07:27.333
I’m not capable!

00:07:27.333 --> 00:07:28.750
Coach, I’m here to bail you out again

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:30.500
OK, sorry, I have to have my family

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:31.333
yell at the Maras

00:07:31.333 --> 00:07:31.833
Goodbye

00:07:31.833 --> 00:07:33.625
What the hell did I do?

00:07:33.625 --> 00:07:35.708
Ruined the Giants, of course

00:07:40.708 --> 00:07:41.875
Matty, with only three wins

00:07:41.875 --> 00:07:42.750
I don’t feel safe

00:07:42.750 --> 00:07:43.958
We have no defense

00:07:43.958 --> 00:07:44.875
Don’t worry, Julio

00:07:44.875 --> 00:07:46.125
after the incident

00:07:46.125 --> 00:07:48.833
I created a state-of-the-art panic room!

00:07:48.833 --> 00:07:50.958
Wow, I can freak out about not scoring here!

00:07:50.958 --> 00:07:52.250
Are you always stressing

00:07:52.250 --> 00:07:54.083
that your 30-point games aren’t enough?

00:07:54.083 --> 00:07:56.333
You need a panic room today

00:07:56.333 --> 00:07:58.083
I THINK I MISSED MY SUPER BOWL WINDOW

00:07:58.083 --> 00:07:58.500
See?

00:08:01.083 --> 00:08:02.208
Season going poorly?

00:08:02.208 --> 00:08:03.375
Panic with us!

00:08:03.375 --> 00:08:04.958
WE BLEW A 17-POINT LEAD?

00:08:04.958 --> 00:08:06.000
Oh, that’s perfect. I’ll take it.

00:08:06.000 --> 00:08:07.250
I talk a lot of s--t

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.458
but my offense f--king sucks

00:08:08.458 --> 00:08:08.833
MOTHER

00:08:08.833 --> 00:08:09.583
Oh, I don’t need one

00:08:09.583 --> 00:08:11.583
My brain is sort of like my own panic room

00:08:11.583 --> 00:08:12.833
Our rooms come equipped

00:08:12.833 --> 00:08:14.375
with a place to tweet frustrations

00:08:14.375 --> 00:08:16.000
a schedule to stress about

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.875
WE PLAY THE RAMS AND THE PATS?!

00:08:17.875 --> 00:08:19.583
and podiums for you to insist

00:08:19.583 --> 00:08:21.083
you’re not panicking at

00:08:21.083 --> 00:08:22.375
I actually feel really good

00:08:22.375 --> 00:08:23.083
about where we’re at

00:08:23.083 --> 00:08:23.583
Thank you

00:08:24.833 --> 00:08:26.000
What if I just want to give up?

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:26.958
Luckily for you

00:08:26.958 --> 00:08:28.458
we have “accepted defeat” rooms

00:08:28.458 --> 00:08:29.333
I'M NOT CRYING

00:08:29.333 --> 00:08:30.458
YOU'RE CRYING

00:08:30.458 --> 00:08:32.083
Each comes with a Larry Fitzgerald

00:08:32.083 --> 00:08:33.458
to make it all better!

00:08:33.458 --> 00:08:34.625
It’s OK if your team is garbage

00:08:34.625 --> 00:08:35.583
as long as everyone loves you!

00:08:35.583 --> 00:08:36.750
God, he’s so classy

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:37.708
So buy today!

00:08:37.708 --> 00:08:39.958
Because the season isn’t even halfway over

00:08:39.958 --> 00:08:40.708
Ahhh!!!

00:08:45.708 --> 00:08:46.833
It’s pretty awesome no one can mess with

00:08:46.833 --> 00:08:49.083
us STARTING quarterbacks anymore

00:08:49.083 --> 00:08:50.333
Sure, Sure, Yeah, yeah, right

00:08:50.333 --> 00:08:51.208
Out of the way, Von

00:08:51.208 --> 00:08:52.458
It’s a quarterback’s game now

00:08:52.458 --> 00:08:54.333
God, I hate those pretty boys

00:08:54.333 --> 00:08:54.958
Brock, wait up

00:08:54.958 --> 00:08:56.333
I just wanted to say I’m really proud of you

00:08:56.333 --> 00:08:57.500
This is the commencement of

00:08:57.500 --> 00:08:59.208
The Annual Gridiron Heights Purge

00:08:59.208 --> 00:09:01.458
At the siren, any and all penalties

00:09:01.458 --> 00:09:03.083
including roughing the passer

00:09:03.083 --> 00:09:04.208
will be legal

00:09:04.625 --> 00:09:06.500
IT FEELS GOOD TO BE BAD

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:08.500
IT’S LIKE THE NFL FOUR YEARS AGO

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:09.000
IN HERE!

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.208
I’m allowed during the purge!

00:09:10.208 --> 00:09:11.875
Oooooh! The purge looks fun!

00:09:11.875 --> 00:09:12.958
It’s dangerous out there!

00:09:12.958 --> 00:09:15.000
They’re celebrating with hip thrusts!

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:17.458
Oh my God, he’s mimicking a weapon!

00:09:17.458 --> 00:09:19.250
And he’s wearing fun cleats to play

00:09:19.250 --> 00:09:21.000
and not just as a pregame warm-up!

00:09:21.000 --> 00:09:22.625
This is anarchy

00:09:22.625 --> 00:09:24.125
We need to get to Matt Ryan’s panic room

00:09:24.125 --> 00:09:25.833
THE REAL PURGE IS MENTAL, OK?!

00:09:25.833 --> 00:09:27.500
NO PURGE IS PURGIER THAN THE PURGE

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.833
YOU’RE GOING THROUGH UP HERE OK

00:09:28.833 --> 00:09:29.208
BREAK

00:09:29.208 --> 00:09:29.458
OK

00:09:29.458 --> 00:09:29.958
Cool

00:09:29.958 --> 00:09:30.750
Thanks for that

00:09:30.750 --> 00:09:32.250
You must love the purge, Vontaze

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:33.458
What’s the purge?

00:09:33.458 --> 00:09:33.958
Baker!

00:09:33.958 --> 00:09:34.625
I got purged

00:09:34.625 --> 00:09:36.083
Coach, no!!!

00:09:36.458 --> 00:09:37.333
Save yourselves

00:09:37.333 --> 00:09:38.333
SCRAMBLE!

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.125
Trick or treat!

00:09:40.125 --> 00:09:40.958
Here’s a treat

00:09:40.958 --> 00:09:43.125
an extra-long episode of Gridiron Heights!

00:09:43.125 --> 00:09:43.750
Wow!

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:44.208
Yay!

00:09:44.208 --> 00:09:45.625
Told ya this neighborhood rules

00:09:45.625 --> 00:09:46.708
Checkdown to be safe

00:09:46.708 --> 00:09:47.833
Checkdown to- OOF

00:09:47.833 --> 00:09:48.875
I DON’T THINK I CAN KEEP

00:09:48.875 --> 00:09:50.083
UP WITH YOUS ALL

00:09:50.083 --> 00:09:51.000
Well, yeah

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:51.833
We’re almost there!

00:09:52.625 --> 00:09:54.958
Well, I guess there’s still the wild card

00:09:56.000 --> 00:09:57.583
The purge is my cheat day

00:09:57.750 --> 00:09:59.083
Sorry I have to sack you

00:09:59.083 --> 00:10:00.333
No, that’s OK!

00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:01.000
Great sack!

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:02.708
Great job being sacked!

00:10:02.708 --> 00:10:03.458
JJ, look

00:10:03.458 --> 00:10:04.583
I’m having a good season!

00:10:04.583 --> 00:10:05.875
I HATE CHARITY

00:10:05.875 --> 00:10:07.583
THE MONEY IS ALL MINE NOW!

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:08.708
GOOD JOB!

00:10:08.708 --> 00:10:11.083
NOW BRING ME MORE HEADS, BOYS

00:10:11.375 --> 00:10:13.333
WHY ARE YOU DOING THIS TO US?!

00:10:13.333 --> 00:10:15.083
Don’t you see all the good the purge does?

00:10:15.083 --> 00:10:16.833
It lets the defense get out their aggressions

00:10:50.625 --> 00:10:51.541
Hey, can we stay with you?

00:10:51.541 --> 00:10:52.750
The StubHub Center is hosting

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.125
a flipping soccer practice

00:10:54.125 --> 00:10:55.125
Sorry, man, we’re in mourning

00:10:55.125 --> 00:10:56.916
I let down my fantasy teams again!

00:10:56.916 --> 00:10:58.291
Nobody fluffin respects us!

00:10:58.291 --> 00:10:59.416
We’re the GD front-runners

00:10:59.416 --> 00:11:00.500
for an AFC Wild Card!

00:11:00.500 --> 00:11:01.750
Bruh, where are we?

00:11:01.750 --> 00:11:02.125
KIKO!!

00:11:02.125 --> 00:11:03.125
K-K-K-K-KIKO!

00:11:03.125 --> 00:11:04.875
Welcome to the Florida section

00:11:04.875 --> 00:11:06.125
of Gridiron Heights!

00:11:08.875 --> 00:11:10.791
How have I never noticed this place?

00:11:10.791 --> 00:11:12.125
Probably because it’s only for

00:11:12.125 --> 00:11:12.875
underperforming teams with

00:11:12.875 --> 00:11:14.166
with quarterback controversies

00:11:14.166 --> 00:11:15.375
And bath salts!

00:11:15.375 --> 00:11:16.125
Let me give you a tour—

00:11:16.125 --> 00:11:17.000
I’ll take it from here

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:18.375
Since I’m the most Florida person

00:11:18.375 --> 00:11:18.875
you’ll ever meet—

00:11:18.875 --> 00:11:19.416
AHHHH!

00:11:19.416 --> 00:11:20.000
And I’m back

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.375
Over here we have our own hospital

00:11:21.375 --> 00:11:22.625
Why aren’t we getting better?!

00:11:22.625 --> 00:11:24.916
Guess you need&nbsp;another year to evaluate me!

00:11:24.916 --> 00:11:26.750
And that’s where the Jags D practices

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:28.416
OK, why am I the only one who showed up?

00:11:28.416 --> 00:11:29.250
That’s our house!

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:29.791
Woah

00:11:29.791 --> 00:11:31.125
We built it in ‘72 and

00:11:31.125 --> 00:11:32.625
have sort of coasted since then

00:11:32.625 --> 00:11:33.916
So where do you guys want to eat?

00:11:33.916 --> 00:11:35.541
P-Rivs, let’s go home

00:11:35.541 --> 00:11:36.250
Stay!

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:37.666
You can be the Kissimmee Chargers

00:11:37.666 --> 00:11:39.000
and play inside the Medieval Times!

00:11:39.000 --> 00:11:40.000
We need stars here

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:41.166
We’ve been starting a manatee

00:11:41.166 --> 00:11:42.375
at left tackle for years

00:11:42.375 --> 00:11:43.666
L.A. CAN KISS MY TUCKUS!

00:11:43.666 --> 00:11:44.375
I’M STAYING HERE!

00:11:44.375 --> 00:11:45.916
But we just signed a thousand-year lease!

00:11:47.291 --> 00:11:48.875
I’M MAKING ANOTHER CULTURE CHANGE

00:11:48.875 --> 00:11:49.666
EVERYONE, OUT

00:11:49.666 --> 00:11:50.625
Yeah, OK, let’s leave

00:11:55.625 --> 00:11:57.166
Coach, our flight to Mexico City

00:11:57.166 --> 00:11:59.125
doesn’t leave for another 10 hours!

00:11:59.125 --> 00:12:00.666
Hey, you gotta be prepared for everything

00:12:00.750 --> 00:12:01.750
I DID IT AGAIN

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:03.041
I DIDN’T LEAVE ENOUGH TIME

00:12:03.041 --> 00:12:04.000
GO. GO. GO.

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:04.375
HURRY

00:12:07.125 --> 00:12:09.500
WOW, NO TRAFFIC!!!!

00:12:10.250 --> 00:12:12.000
Let’s practice the Spanish I made you all learn

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.500
Dónde esta la end zone?

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.291
Aqui esta la end zone

00:12:17.375 --> 00:12:18.125
LEAVE ALL YOUR STUFF

00:12:18.125 --> 00:12:19.166
WE’LL GET MORE KANSAS CITY

00:12:19.166 --> 00:12:20.125
BARBECUE IN MEXICO

00:12:20.125 --> 00:12:21.000
Yo, I hope it’s cool

00:12:21.000 --> 00:12:22.125
but I have like 20 carry-ons

00:12:22.125 --> 00:12:23.666
I’m detecting a lot of weapons

00:12:23.666 --> 00:12:26.291
HEY EVERYBODY, THE CHIEFS ARE HERE!

00:12:26.291 --> 00:12:28.500
I think we have two potentially explosive offenses

00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:29.666
RPO! RPO!

00:12:30.541 --> 00:12:30.875
ATTENTION

00:12:30.875 --> 00:12:31.875
THE GAME IN MEXICO CITY

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:34.750
THE FLIGHT IS LEAVING RIGHT NOW

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:35.250
Better hurry

00:12:35.250 --> 00:12:37.000
I think I have a game script for this somewhere

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:38.375
I have the perfect play

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:41.000
Oh God, they’re both so innovative

00:12:41.000 --> 00:12:42.250
Hey man, we’re the same!

00:12:42.250 --> 00:12:43.625
We’re both front-runners!

00:12:43.625 --> 00:12:45.291
I am very clearly in front of you

00:12:45.875 --> 00:12:46.625
We made it!

00:12:46.625 --> 00:12:47.791
HELL YEAH! LET’S GO!

00:12:47.791 --> 00:12:48.875
Come on, Travis, get on the plane

00:12:48.875 --> 00:12:50.750
MAN, TRAVELING IS SO STRESS-FREE

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:52.541
LOOK AT ALL THIS LEG ROOM!

00:12:53.166 --> 00:12:54.125
MY DEFENSE!

00:12:54.125 --> 00:12:55.625
Always an afterthought

00:13:00.625 --> 00:13:02.125
Welcome to dinner for all the teams

00:13:02.125 --> 00:13:03.500
who have to play on Thanksgiving!

00:13:03.625 --> 00:13:05.416
I brought my famous green bean casserole

00:13:05.416 --> 00:13:07.291
It’s pretty good, but it’s not gonna win any awards

00:13:07.291 --> 00:13:08.416
I wish we could go out to the bar

00:13:08.416 --> 00:13:10.000
tonight like the other teams

00:13:10.000 --> 00:13:11.500
ELI, IT’S BEEN YEARS!

00:13:11.500 --> 00:13:12.541
HOW YOU BEEN, MAN?!

00:13:12.541 --> 00:13:14.250
We’re undefeated in November!

00:13:14.250 --> 00:13:15.875
YO, JAMES CONNER IS DOING KARAOKE!

00:13:19.166 --> 00:13:20.875
We’ve got some exciting news in the middle

00:13:20.875 --> 00:13:22.250
of this Gridiron Heights episode

00:13:22.250 --> 00:13:24.541
PS4 and VR Bundles are starting at $199

00:13:24.541 --> 00:13:25.625
during Black Friday week!

00:13:25.625 --> 00:13:26.166
GOBBLE, GOBBLE

00:13:26.166 --> 00:13:27.875
Taysom, more pepper!

00:13:27.875 --> 00:13:28.750
Hey man, let me take that

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:29.750
I think you’re finished

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:30.875
Pass this around to Khalil

00:13:30.875 --> 00:13:31.875
Just pass left, Mitchell

00:13:31.875 --> 00:13:32.500
A toast!

00:13:32.500 --> 00:13:33.875
We may not see all of you next year—

00:13:33.875 --> 00:13:34.291
Wait, what?

00:13:34.291 --> 00:13:35.541
But we love coming together

00:13:35.541 --> 00:13:36.750
To friendly competition!

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.500
Careful, Matt, don’t choke

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:40.250
WHERE’S DREW’S MVP, SEAN?!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.125
SIT UP STRAIGHT

00:13:41.125 --> 00:13:42.750
BE FANCY AND PROFESSIONAL LIKE ME

00:13:42.750 --> 00:13:44.291
Hey, Stafford, you want seconds?

00:13:44.291 --> 00:13:45.125
Uh, sure

00:13:45.125 --> 00:13:46.125
I’m Colt McCoy

00:13:46.125 --> 00:13:48.291
and I’m still the most popular quarterback in Texas

00:13:48.291 --> 00:13:49.875
THE NFC EAST COULD BE MINE

00:13:49.875 --> 00:13:50.875
INTERCEPTION

00:13:50.875 --> 00:13:51.791
I BLAME THE FANS

00:13:51.791 --> 00:13:53.000
TAYSOM, START THE CAR

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.000
Already done, sir

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.000
Hey, what exactly is Taysom Hill’s job?

00:13:56.000 --> 00:13:57.125
NOBODY KNOWS

00:13:57.125 --> 00:13:58.666
I could kick Dan Quinn’s ass

00:13:58.666 --> 00:13:59.375
I’m good now

00:13:59.375 --> 00:14:00.625
Happy Thanksgiving

00:14:05.625 --> 00:14:06.125
Hey T.Y.!

00:14:06.125 --> 00:14:07.875
Just calling to make sure everything’s A-OK!

00:14:07.875 --> 00:14:09.166
Yeah, Andrew, you called five minutes ago.

00:14:09.166 --> 00:14:09.875
I’m fine-

00:14:09.875 --> 00:14:11.625
Wait, someone’s coming for the AFC South.

00:14:12.000 --> 00:14:13.750
But I was only hurt for three years!

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:15.125
OK, T.Y., go deep.

00:14:15.125 --> 00:14:16.750
The next part is very important.

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:17.916
They're gonna take the division.

00:14:17.916 --> 00:14:19.375
AAHHHHHHH! I SEE TEXANS-

00:14:19.375 --> 00:14:20.000
EIGHT STRAIGHT WINS!

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:20.916
THEY SAY THEY HAVE A NUKE!

00:14:20.916 --> 00:14:21.750
DESHAUN WATSON!

00:14:21.750 --> 00:14:22.625
Oh golly!

00:14:22.625 --> 00:14:22.875
I don't know who you are

00:14:22.875 --> 00:14:23.791
I don't know who you are

00:14:23.791 --> 00:14:24.791
I don't know what you want

00:14:24.791 --> 00:14:25.541
but I’m Andrew.

00:14:25.541 --> 00:14:26.166
Hello!

00:14:28.791 --> 00:14:30.375
I have a very particular set of skills

00:14:30.375 --> 00:14:32.375
skills I have acquired over almost half a career.

00:14:32.375 --> 00:14:33.541
Skills like accuracy

00:14:33.541 --> 00:14:34.375
good decision-making

00:14:34.375 --> 00:14:35.875
and recommending the perfect book.

00:14:35.875 --> 00:14:36.750
Sorry for evading you!

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:37.541
Good try though!

00:14:37.541 --> 00:14:38.250
So close!

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:39.250
Skills that make me a nightmare

00:14:39.250 --> 00:14:40.125
for people like you

00:14:40.125 --> 00:14:41.250
and I’m sorry about that.

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:42.166
I need you to be focused!

00:14:42.166 --> 00:14:43.000
So we all play our best!

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:45.041
HE’S GOING TO TORCH OUR DEFENSE!

00:14:45.041 --> 00:14:46.625
If you let the AFC South go now

00:14:46.625 --> 00:14:47.500
that'll be the end of it!

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:48.916
Oh boy, what kind of a person would

00:14:48.916 --> 00:14:50.625
hang out in a gross place like this?

00:14:50.625 --> 00:14:51.875
Oh, hello Mr. Irsay!

00:14:51.875 --> 00:14:53.750
Andrew, man, I like you, man.

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:54.375
But if you don't

00:14:54.375 --> 00:14:55.166
I will look for you

00:14:55.166 --> 00:14:55.875
I will find you

00:14:55.875 --> 00:14:56.750
you silly goose

00:14:56.750 --> 00:14:58.125
and I will absolutely destroy you.

00:14:58.125 --> 00:15:00.916
Uh, I can’t tell if he’s threatening us or not.

00:15:00.916 --> 00:15:01.375
Hi guys!

00:15:01.375 --> 00:15:02.875
You forget how mobile he is.

00:15:02.875 --> 00:15:03.250
Get him!

00:15:03.250 --> 00:15:04.125
I have cover now!

00:15:04.125 --> 00:15:05.541
AAAAAAAHHHHHHH!

00:15:10.583 --> 00:15:12.458
Gather round for the Week 14 playoff picture!

00:15:12.458 --> 00:15:13.958
How do you all like your sweaters?!

00:15:13.958 --> 00:15:14.583
Oh they're so good.

00:15:14.583 --> 00:15:15.333
I LOVE IT!

00:15:15.333 --> 00:15:17.083
Get out of my way, Mahomes—

00:15:17.083 --> 00:15:17.375
HEY!

00:15:17.375 --> 00:15:18.333
IF YOU ALL COULD JUST BEHAVE

00:15:18.333 --> 00:15:19.833
I’LL BUY YA’LL GD FRENCH FRIES

00:15:19.833 --> 00:15:20.833
AT THE FUDGING FOOD COURT.

00:16:15.583 --> 00:16:16.583
Welcome to the Saints.

00:16:16.583 --> 00:16:17.708
The first rule of Drew Brees

00:16:17.708 --> 00:16:19.333
is you don’t talk about Drew Brees.

00:16:19.333 --> 00:16:20.708
The second rule of Drew Brees

00:16:20.708 --> 00:16:22.083
is that when you do talk about him

00:16:22.083 --> 00:16:23.583
you mention that he’s a great football player

00:16:23.583 --> 00:16:24.500
but an even better man.

00:16:24.500 --> 00:16:25.333
He’s so nice.

00:16:27.958 --> 00:16:29.500
Like many of you, I was stuck.

00:16:29.625 --> 00:16:31.625
I’d go through 7-9 seasons and wonder

00:16:31.625 --> 00:16:33.250
“How do these consistent passing records

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:34.458
define me as a person?”

00:16:34.458 --> 00:16:35.833
I’d pray for a different life.

00:16:35.833 --> 00:16:37.208
I want you to line up as a receiver.

00:16:37.208 --> 00:16:38.000
What?

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:38.833
I want you.

00:16:38.833 --> 00:16:39.625
To line up.

00:16:39.625 --> 00:16:40.708
As a receiver.

00:16:41.458 --> 00:16:43.375
What if we did wacky stuff on offense all the time?

00:16:43.375 --> 00:16:45.333
Thus began Project Mayhem.

00:16:45.333 --> 00:16:47.000
Did you go for it on 4th down?

00:16:47.000 --> 00:16:48.458
Which f--king time?

00:16:48.458 --> 00:16:49.333
Someone beat the Rams

00:16:49.333 --> 00:16:50.833
and the question everyone is asking...

00:16:50.833 --> 00:16:51.583
who dat?

00:16:51.708 --> 00:16:52.958
Our offense is getting too dangerous.

00:16:52.958 --> 00:16:54.083
We have to stop this.

00:16:54.083 --> 00:16:54.708
Sorry sir,

00:16:54.708 --> 00:16:56.833
we must do everything to completions.

00:16:56.833 --> 00:17:00.833
His name was Desmond Bryant.

00:17:00.875 --> 00:17:01.750
I’m coming back.

00:17:01.958 --> 00:17:03.125
Coach, Taysom Hill is taking over.

00:17:03.125 --> 00:17:04.583
He’s running, he’s passing, he’s blocking, he’s-

00:17:04.583 --> 00:17:05.333
That’s impossible!

00:17:05.333 --> 00:17:06.500
Nobody like that exists.

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:07.458
You were looking for a way

00:17:07.458 --> 00:17:09.083
to stop being boring and great,

00:17:09.083 --> 00:17:09.833
so you made me up

00:17:09.833 --> 00:17:11.458
so you could be interesting and great.

00:17:12.208 --> 00:17:13.333
Everything’s going to be fine.

00:17:13.333 --> 00:17:14.125
I promise.

00:17:20.583 --> 00:17:21.125
Hey everyone,

00:17:21.125 --> 00:17:23.708
welcome to the Gridiron Heights Christmas party!

00:17:23.708 --> 00:17:24.958
Keep in mind layoffs are coming.

00:17:24.958 --> 00:17:25.458
Oh no.

00:17:25.458 --> 00:17:26.250
I’m freaking out.

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:26.833
No. No. No.

00:17:26.833 --> 00:17:27.708
I’m not being replaced.

00:17:27.708 --> 00:17:28.458
I’m still hurt.

00:17:28.458 --> 00:17:28.833
See!

00:17:28.833 --> 00:17:29.333
OW!

00:17:29.333 --> 00:17:30.250
Santa Gruden,

00:17:30.250 --> 00:17:32.750
I’m giving all my players away, OK?

00:17:32.750 --> 00:17:34.458
And an Amari for you.

00:17:34.458 --> 00:17:35.708
WOAH, A RECEIVER!

00:17:35.708 --> 00:17:36.958
I’ve never had one before.

00:17:36.958 --> 00:17:38.333
Hey, who wants a Derek Carr?!

00:17:38.333 --> 00:17:39.708
Hey, how about you, Dan Snyder, man?

00:17:39.708 --> 00:17:41.583
He’s only $125 million?!

00:17:41.583 --> 00:17:42.708
Oh, can I, Jerry?

00:17:42.708 --> 00:17:43.500
Please?!

00:17:46.208 --> 00:17:47.583
OK, Odell, this is a work event.

00:17:47.583 --> 00:17:48.458
Behave yourself.

00:17:49.333 --> 00:17:49.583
WOOO!

00:17:49.583 --> 00:17:51.375
I HAVE STRONG OPINIONS ABOUT ALL OF YOU!

00:17:51.750 --> 00:17:52.583
That’s a fine-

00:17:52.583 --> 00:17:54.458
HEY, WOAH WOAH ZEKE, I’LL FINE YOU TOO-

00:17:54.458 --> 00:17:55.083
THANK YOU.

00:17:55.083 --> 00:17:56.208
I just came to get my stuff.

00:17:56.208 --> 00:17:57.708
You’re having a party without me?

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:00.750
I’m having the time of my life.

00:18:00.750 --> 00:18:01.833
I’m back!

00:18:01.833 --> 00:18:04.708
Gronk may be too old for this.

00:18:05.333 --> 00:18:06.458
OK, the NFC's a mess.

00:18:06.458 --> 00:18:07.208
YEAH IT IS.

00:18:07.208 --> 00:18:08.208
Where’s Eli?

00:18:08.208 --> 00:18:09.333
Oh, he’s babysitting.

00:18:09.375 --> 00:18:10.125
PEW! PEW!

00:18:10.125 --> 00:18:11.500
LET’S PRETEND PLAYOFFS!

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.208
NO!

00:18:12.208 --> 00:18:13.583
I’M GOING FOR REAL!

00:18:13.583 --> 00:18:14.958
IF YOU GUYS DON’T GO TO BED,

00:18:14.958 --> 00:18:16.083
SANTA WON’T COME.

00:18:16.083 --> 00:18:17.625
I’M TALL, BUT I CAN RUN.

00:18:17.625 --> 00:18:20.583
WHY ARE THESE KIDS SO MOBILE?!

00:18:25.583 --> 00:18:27.125
Another year without the postseason…

00:18:27.125 --> 00:18:28.708
Dear God, or the Dalai Lama or whatever,

00:18:28.708 --> 00:18:29.750
I don’t know, I’m still searching-

00:18:30.125 --> 00:18:31.208
Please show me the way.

00:18:31.208 --> 00:18:32.125
JORDY NELSON?!

00:18:32.125 --> 00:18:33.625
Now I hope you weren’t trying to tank.

00:18:33.625 --> 00:18:34.625
Tanking’s a sin.

00:18:34.625 --> 00:18:35.250
No, but sometimes I wish

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.708
I was just never even drafted at all.

00:18:37.083 --> 00:18:37.833
That’s an idea.

00:18:37.833 --> 00:18:39.208
What do you think, Vince Lombardi?

00:18:39.208 --> 00:18:40.333
OK. I agree.

00:18:40.333 --> 00:18:41.583
You’ve never been drafted.

00:18:41.583 --> 00:18:42.583
Hey, my leg stopped hurting-

00:18:42.583 --> 00:18:43.208
What.

00:18:43.208 --> 00:18:44.500
I’m 49 years old

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:46.375
and I’m still the quarterback of the Packers.

00:18:49.333 --> 00:18:51.333
Without you, Brett Favre wouldn’t leave.

00:18:51.333 --> 00:18:53.458
The Packers haven’t won a game in 10 years.

00:18:53.458 --> 00:18:54.708
State Farm shut down.

00:18:54.708 --> 00:18:56.458
Nobody was here to discount double check.

00:18:56.833 --> 00:18:59.583
The Bears won that 2010 NFC championship.

00:18:59.583 --> 00:19:01.958
I’m Jay Cutler, and I never give up.

00:19:01.958 --> 00:19:03.583
Clay! Clay, don’t you know me?

00:19:03.583 --> 00:19:05.625
HELP! THIS MAN IS SCARING ME!

00:19:05.625 --> 00:19:06.833
JORDY! GET ME BACK.

00:19:06.833 --> 00:19:08.708
I want to be on the Packers again!

00:19:09.333 --> 00:19:10.083
Hey Aaron-

00:19:10.083 --> 00:19:11.083
Hey, watch your-

00:19:11.625 --> 00:19:12.625
MY LEG’S HURTING, BRETT!

00:19:12.625 --> 00:19:13.708
MY LEG’S HURTING!

00:19:13.708 --> 00:19:15.583
MERRY CHRISTMAS GREEN BAY!

00:19:15.583 --> 00:19:16.125
Aaron!

00:19:16.125 --> 00:19:17.958
The owner’s going to make changes!

00:19:17.958 --> 00:19:19.333
We are going to hire someone

00:19:19.333 --> 00:19:21.250
with imaginative play-calling!

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:22.958
Every time a whistle blows

00:19:22.958 --> 00:19:23.958
the Packers still have

00:19:23.958 --> 00:19:25.583
more rings than the Bears.

00:19:30.583 --> 00:19:32.208
We’re gonna have to do the shuffle again.

00:19:32.208 --> 00:19:34.583
Shuff-shuffle again. Do the shuffle again.

00:19:34.583 --> 00:19:36.583
2019, it’s the shuffle remix.

00:19:36.583 --> 00:19:39.333
Reminisce cause we missed '85, '86.

00:19:39.333 --> 00:19:40.583
Leader of the offense.

00:19:40.583 --> 00:19:41.958
The defense is so fresh,

00:19:41.958 --> 00:19:42.708
I’m in the NFL

00:19:42.708 --> 00:19:44.333
and I just learned how to throw left.

00:19:44.333 --> 00:19:45.208
I can scramble, I can run

00:19:45.208 --> 00:19:46.708
I can throw touch passes.

00:19:46.708 --> 00:19:47.958
And I’m livin’ in the city with the

00:19:47.958 --> 00:19:49.333
most mustaches.

00:19:49.333 --> 00:19:50.333
Nagy can nag me

00:19:50.333 --> 00:19:51.375
but don’t call me Mitch.

00:19:51.375 --> 00:19:52.708
And my name ain’t Jay Cutler

00:19:52.708 --> 00:19:53.625
so don’t call me-

00:19:53.958 --> 00:19:54.208
Whatever?!

00:19:54.208 --> 00:19:55.208
Go to Club Dub.

00:19:55.208 --> 00:19:56.375
We all got up in

00:19:56.375 --> 00:19:58.833
bringing back '86 with the shuffle again.

00:19:59.083 --> 00:19:59.958
Last name Cohen

00:19:59.958 --> 00:20:01.250
so I get a bar mitzvah.

00:20:01.250 --> 00:20:02.375
And I got a new sweater

00:20:02.375 --> 00:20:03.958
so I’m dressed like Mike Ditka.

00:20:03.958 --> 00:20:06.083
And we don’t mean this is a mean way

00:20:06.083 --> 00:20:07.250
Cheese-eating hillbillies

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:08.625
all live in Green Bay.

00:20:08.625 --> 00:20:09.375
D-D-D-DEFENSE!!!!!!!

00:20:09.375 --> 00:20:09.958
Check the movement

00:20:09.958 --> 00:20:10.750
monsters of the midway

00:20:10.750 --> 00:20:11.833
defense superhuman.

00:20:11.833 --> 00:20:13.333
Never losin’, and we get stupid

00:20:13.333 --> 00:20:15.208
stupid like when I was traded by Gruden.

00:20:15.208 --> 00:20:16.208
Turn a player to a hater

00:20:16.208 --> 00:20:16.833
when I hit a player

00:20:16.833 --> 00:20:17.500
QB incinerator

00:20:17.500 --> 00:20:18.583
imitator of refrigerator.

00:20:18.583 --> 00:20:19.000
HICKS.

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:19.375
FULLER.

00:20:19.375 --> 00:20:20.083
JACKSON.

00:20:20.083 --> 00:20:21.458
Defense killin’.

00:20:21.458 --> 00:20:22.708
And I’m worth 2 first-round draft picks

00:20:22.708 --> 00:20:24.000
and $141 million.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.375
In 2019, take it back to '86.

00:20:26.375 --> 00:20:27.583
When we win, we’ll do

00:20:27.583 --> 00:20:29.083
the Super Bowl Shuffle remix.

00:20:29.083 --> 00:20:29.750
Hopefully.

00:20:35.250 --> 00:20:36.375
Listen up, gentlemen.

00:20:36.375 --> 00:20:38.916
You morons may have only let me win 11 games.

00:20:38.916 --> 00:20:39.916
We suck. We're...

00:20:39.916 --> 00:20:41.041
NOT GETTING MINNESOTA MIRACLE’D

00:20:41.041 --> 00:20:42.291
BY THE F--KING EAGLES THIS—

00:20:42.291 --> 00:20:43.958
year may be Jared’s last chance

00:20:43.958 --> 00:20:44.833
before we replace him

00:20:44.833 --> 00:20:46.041
with another cheap rookie.

00:20:46.041 --> 00:20:46.750
I’m sorry, what?

00:20:46.750 --> 00:20:48.750
I SAID I DON’T EVEN LOOK WHEN I THROW.

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:49.541
WOO-HOO! YEAH!

00:20:52.166 --> 00:20:52.666
Settle down

00:20:52.666 --> 00:20:53.541
I know everyone is depressed

00:20:53.541 --> 00:20:54.750
because we’re a two seed

00:20:54.750 --> 00:20:55.958
but we have to stick together.

00:20:55.958 --> 00:20:56.375
Gilmore

00:20:56.375 --> 00:20:57.125
what happens when we're

00:20:57.125 --> 00:20:58.500
five seconds late to a meeting?

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:00.083
We get yelled at till we cry?

00:21:00.083 --> 00:21:00.666
And Gronk

00:21:00.666 --> 00:21:01.416
remember when you were

00:21:01.416 --> 00:21:02.500
unhappy with the team?

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:03.875
PATRIOTS TRIED TO TRADE GRONK

00:21:03.875 --> 00:21:05.333
AFTER THEY BROKE GRONK’S BODY.

00:21:05.333 --> 00:21:07.041
And Josh Gordon, remem-

00:21:07.041 --> 00:21:08.666
Oh right. We have no—

00:21:08.666 --> 00:21:10.166
RECEIVERS MUST GET TACKLED

00:21:10.166 --> 00:21:11.375
ON THE LAST PLAY OF THE—

00:21:11.375 --> 00:21:12.250
game reminds me of the

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:15.291
1918 Dayton Triangles/Toledo Maroons game

00:21:15.333 --> 00:21:16.250
where they had a secret—

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:16.875
weapon.

00:21:16.875 --> 00:21:19.125
ANDY REID AFTER A BYE WEEK!!!

00:21:19.125 --> 00:21:20.708
I HAVE TIME, BOYS!

00:21:20.708 --> 00:21:21.416
HE’S BACK!

00:21:21.416 --> 00:21:21.833
And yes

00:21:21.833 --> 00:21:22.875
there’s stuff to worry about

00:21:22.875 --> 00:21:23.833
like aging—

00:21:23.833 --> 00:21:24.708
And Zeke

00:21:24.708 --> 00:21:25.375
And the fact that

00:21:25.375 --> 00:21:26.875
Bountygate clearly angered God

00:21:26.875 --> 00:21:28.500
AND HURTING MY FRIEND THE FOOTBALL

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:30.041
BY THROWING IT TOO HARD.

00:21:30.041 --> 00:21:31.416
BUT THIS IS OUR YEAR.

00:21:31.416 --> 00:21:33.666
BIG NICK HERE TO DOUBLE DOINK EVERYONE!

00:21:33.666 --> 00:21:35.083
- Oh Christ!
- Oh Muskrats!

00:21:40.083 --> 00:21:42.000
Welcome to Elimination Creek Country Club.

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:43.458
I believe you know your way around, Dak.

00:21:43.458 --> 00:21:44.125
Just give me a drink.

00:21:44.125 --> 00:21:44.625
This sucks.

00:21:44.625 --> 00:21:46.208
We are very depressed.

00:21:46.208 --> 00:21:47.125
The club is nice.

00:21:47.125 --> 00:21:48.208
I’m getting almost as much rest

00:21:48.208 --> 00:21:49.458
as I did in the Wild Card Game.

00:21:49.458 --> 00:21:49.833
Yeah.

00:21:49.833 --> 00:21:50.833
Now all the charities

00:21:50.833 --> 00:21:51.958
know I have free time....

00:21:51.958 --> 00:21:52.875
FUDGE THE OFFSEASON!

00:21:52.875 --> 00:21:54.250
I WANT FRICKIN' FOOTBALL!

00:21:54.583 --> 00:21:55.625
Phil, Phil, PHIL, PHIL!

00:21:59.958 --> 00:22:00.833
Can I just run it?

00:22:00.833 --> 00:22:01.333
Hey, maybe I—

00:22:01.333 --> 00:22:01.833
Sorry, sir.

00:22:01.833 --> 00:22:03.208
Starters only at the club.

00:22:03.208 --> 00:22:03.708
I’M ELITE.

00:22:03.708 --> 00:22:04.833
I’ll be one of Washington’s

00:22:04.833 --> 00:22:06.333
five starting quarterbacks next year.

00:22:07.500 --> 00:22:08.083
Not again.

00:22:08.083 --> 00:22:08.708
YOU GOT THIS.

00:22:08.708 --> 00:22:09.333
NEVER CHOKE.

00:22:09.333 --> 00:22:10.250
BELIEVE IN YOURSELF.

00:22:10.458 --> 00:22:10.750
All right

00:22:10.750 --> 00:22:11.708
well great season everyone.

00:22:11.708 --> 00:22:12.875
See you next year! Much love.

00:22:12.875 --> 00:22:13.625
By the way, man

00:22:13.625 --> 00:22:15.083
I’m totally cool with outbursts.

00:22:15.083 --> 00:22:16.375
So now that my fourth OC has left

00:22:16.375 --> 00:22:17.000
I have to wonder

00:22:17.000 --> 00:22:18.208
am I the problem?

00:22:18.208 --> 00:22:19.875
CANNONBALL, hahaha!

00:22:19.875 --> 00:22:20.875
Tough elimination, man.

00:22:20.875 --> 00:22:21.375
That’s OK!

00:22:21.375 --> 00:22:22.083
This time last year

00:22:22.083 --> 00:22:23.583
I was legally dead lol.

00:22:23.708 --> 00:22:24.708
BRING IT ON!

00:22:24.958 --> 00:22:26.958
OH NO. MY POWER ZONE!

00:22:26.958 --> 00:22:27.833
I’M TRANSFORMING BACK

00:22:27.833 --> 00:22:29.333
TO REGULAR-SEASON NICK.

00:22:29.333 --> 00:22:30.833
So the trick is to just have

00:22:30.833 --> 00:22:32.458
your family yell at the owners—

00:22:32.458 --> 00:22:33.375
OW, DADDY!

00:22:33.375 --> 00:22:34.250
Must be the players on the

00:22:34.250 --> 00:22:35.750
playoff course across the street.

00:22:35.750 --> 00:22:36.583
Can you throw it back?

00:22:36.583 --> 00:22:38.083
It’s only like 400 yards.

00:22:38.083 --> 00:22:39.208
Why are you having fun?

00:22:39.208 --> 00:22:40.083
This is a game.

00:22:45.291 --> 00:22:46.791
Everyone here in Gridiron Heights

00:22:46.791 --> 00:22:47.958
is gearing up for the only game

00:22:47.958 --> 00:22:49.333
that truly matters:

00:22:49.333 --> 00:22:50.916
the Pro Bowl.

00:22:53.041 --> 00:22:53.916
AGAIN.

00:22:53.916 --> 00:22:55.958
You boys didn’t practice for two whole days

00:22:55.958 --> 00:22:57.708
to lose this game. AGAIN.

00:22:57.708 --> 00:22:58.583
CLEAR EYES.

00:22:58.583 --> 00:22:59.208
FULL HEARTS.

00:22:59.208 --> 00:23:00.458
PRO BOWL!!!

00:23:00.708 --> 00:23:02.166
Coach, I got the votes.

00:23:02.166 --> 00:23:02.833
I can play.

00:23:02.833 --> 00:23:04.458
Son, I am so proud of you.

00:23:04.458 --> 00:23:05.833
You’re a Pro Bowl alternate.

00:23:05.833 --> 00:23:06.833
Here’s to God

00:23:06.833 --> 00:23:07.333
football

00:23:07.333 --> 00:23:09.208
and the 2019 AFC Pro Bowl team.

00:23:09.208 --> 00:23:10.291
AFC FOREVER!!!

00:23:10.291 --> 00:23:11.708
You guys are my brothers.

00:23:11.708 --> 00:23:12.583
Hey, I’m JuJu by the way.

00:23:12.583 --> 00:23:13.541
I play for the Steelers.

00:23:13.541 --> 00:23:14.458
- My name is Keenan Allen.
- Hi I’m Quenton Nelson.

00:23:14.458 --> 00:23:15.666
- Nice to meet you.
- Nice to meet you.

00:23:15.666 --> 00:23:16.583
Wow.

00:23:16.583 --> 00:23:18.958
The Camping World Stadium in Orlando, Florida.

00:23:18.958 --> 00:23:20.458
Doesn’t get much better than this.

00:23:20.458 --> 00:23:22.208
They play the Citrus Bowl here...

00:23:22.208 --> 00:23:23.458
OK boys, we’re just going to play

00:23:23.458 --> 00:23:24.708
good ol’ half-speed football

00:23:24.708 --> 00:23:25.958
with minimal tackling.

00:23:25.958 --> 00:23:26.833
OH, I’M SO BUMMED

00:23:26.833 --> 00:23:28.583
I CAN’T PLAY IN THIS BIG GAME.

00:23:28.791 --> 00:23:29.958
WIN THIS FOR ME, SON.

00:23:29.958 --> 00:23:31.208
Pro Bowls and memories.

00:23:31.208 --> 00:23:32.416
That’s all you got.

00:23:32.416 --> 00:23:33.333
YOU BEST PLAY 3!

00:23:33.333 --> 00:23:34.958
YOU’RE EMBARRASSING ME, COACH.

00:23:34.958 --> 00:23:36.208
3...you’re in.

00:23:36.208 --> 00:23:36.708
Hut hut!

00:23:36.708 --> 00:23:37.291
Wilson takes the snap.

00:23:37.291 --> 00:23:38.416
Oh, Miller’s coming for him!

00:23:38.416 --> 00:23:39.416
There you go. There you go.

00:23:39.416 --> 00:23:40.333
Goodnight.

00:23:40.333 --> 00:23:41.291
[Gasps]

00:23:41.291 --> 00:23:42.791
We want to apologize to the millions

00:23:42.791 --> 00:23:43.583
and millions of children

00:23:43.583 --> 00:23:45.083
at home watching the Pro Bowl.

00:23:50.083 --> 00:23:50.750
Smile!

00:23:50.750 --> 00:23:52.125
For even in elimination

00:23:52.125 --> 00:23:53.875
you have become children of Brady!

00:23:53.875 --> 00:23:55.708
We have a 25-point lead.

00:23:56.583 --> 00:23:57.500
Huh, I feel like people are

00:23:57.500 --> 00:23:58.833
never going to let me get over this.

00:23:58.833 --> 00:23:59.458
One more

00:23:59.458 --> 00:24:01.500
and I’ll have just as many as the Steelers!

00:24:04.208 --> 00:24:05.333
Thomas is coming.

00:24:05.333 --> 00:24:07.125
You all in the AFC need to stop him.

00:24:07.125 --> 00:24:07.958
If he wins again

00:24:07.958 --> 00:24:09.625
it will be boring on a scale

00:24:09.625 --> 00:24:11.083
this league has never seen.

00:24:11.083 --> 00:24:12.208
Prepare the offense

00:24:12.208 --> 00:24:13.333
engage all defenses

00:24:13.333 --> 00:24:14.375
and get this man a coach

00:24:14.375 --> 00:24:16.083
who can maximize his serviceable talent!

00:24:16.083 --> 00:24:17.208
Hey, I’m a computer man.

00:24:17.208 --> 00:24:18.000
Something’s wrong.

00:24:18.000 --> 00:24:19.250
St. Louis is deserted.

00:24:19.250 --> 00:24:20.708
All that’s left is baseball

00:24:20.708 --> 00:24:21.750
and a Six Flags.

00:24:21.750 --> 00:24:23.083
STAN KROENKE?!

00:24:23.083 --> 00:24:24.375
WE HAD TO LEAVE ST. LOUIS!

00:24:24.375 --> 00:24:25.833
IT’S A SMALL MARKET TOWN!

00:24:25.833 --> 00:24:27.208
I need you to pay me.

00:24:27.208 --> 00:24:28.958
It’s the only way to stop Brady.

00:24:28.958 --> 00:24:29.958
It can’t be done!

00:24:29.958 --> 00:24:31.000
You play defense!

00:24:31.375 --> 00:24:31.708
RPO.

00:24:31.708 --> 00:24:32.333
Is he OK?

00:24:32.333 --> 00:24:33.333
OH, THAT’S JUST COACH

00:24:33.333 --> 00:24:34.333
TRYING TO GAME PLAN.

00:24:34.500 --> 00:24:36.000
Fun teams in the AFC?

00:24:36.000 --> 00:24:38.208
I will restore order to the universe.

00:24:38.333 --> 00:24:39.500
I’M GOING TO TAKE DOWN THE GOAT!

00:24:39.500 --> 00:24:40.375
It’s working!

00:24:40.375 --> 00:24:41.708
I see so many articles about how this

00:24:41.708 --> 00:24:43.333
could be the end of the Patriots dynasty.

00:24:43.333 --> 00:24:44.333
AH, FUDGING BRADY

00:24:44.333 --> 00:24:46.083
STOPPING ME FROM BEING A G.D. H.O.F.-ER.

00:24:46.083 --> 00:24:47.333
CALM DOWN, PHIL!

00:24:47.333 --> 00:24:47.708
FUDGE.

00:24:47.708 --> 00:24:48.708
In my experience

00:24:48.708 --> 00:24:50.000
giving him back the ball is bad.

00:24:50.000 --> 00:24:51.083
Jeez, we get it.

00:24:51.083 --> 00:24:52.333
Oh hey, look—I got us to overtime!

00:24:52.333 --> 00:24:53.083
Overtime rules.

00:24:53.083 --> 00:24:54.083
Tom gets to punch first.

00:24:54.083 --> 00:24:55.625
If he misses, Patrick gets to punch.

00:24:55.625 --> 00:24:57.083
WAIT, I MIGHT NOT GET TO PLAY?!?!

00:24:57.458 --> 00:24:59.083
Great competitor. Hell of a game.

00:24:59.083 --> 00:25:00.708
We’re at the end of the game now!

00:25:00.708 --> 00:25:02.125
The Rams are our last chance.

00:25:02.125 --> 00:25:04.000
Me and the Rams had a bit of a falling out...

00:25:04.000 --> 00:25:05.958
NO, I SHOULD WIN.

00:25:06.708 --> 00:25:08.333
Oh, sorry! I didn’t see that.

00:25:08.333 --> 00:25:09.375
STOP HOLDING OUT!

00:25:09.375 --> 00:25:10.625
YOU’RE HURTING YOURSELF!

00:25:10.625 --> 00:25:11.333
AHHHHHHHHH!

00:25:11.333 --> 00:25:11.833
OK, Todd

00:25:11.833 --> 00:25:13.083
now may be a good time to unleash

00:25:13.083 --> 00:25:14.083
THE GURLEY!

00:25:14.083 --> 00:25:14.708
AHHHHHHHHH!

00:25:14.708 --> 00:25:15.208
Yo, something weird

00:25:15.208 --> 00:25:16.208
is going on with me right now.

00:25:16.208 --> 00:25:17.208
What are they?

00:25:17.208 --> 00:25:18.583
White no-name position players.

00:25:18.583 --> 00:25:19.500
Totally expendable.

00:25:19.500 --> 00:25:20.333
ATTACK!

00:25:20.333 --> 00:25:21.708
THIS OLD THING STILL WORKS!

00:25:21.958 --> 00:25:22.750
HALLE BERRY!

00:25:22.750 --> 00:25:23.958
I don’t even know who you are.

00:25:23.958 --> 00:25:25.250
Jared’s a system quarterback

00:25:25.250 --> 00:25:26.333
JUST LIKE YOU!

00:25:26.333 --> 00:25:27.458
NOT TRUE!

00:25:29.958 --> 00:25:32.083
You shouldn’t have gone for my head.

00:25:32.083 --> 00:25:32.458
No!

00:25:32.458 --> 00:25:33.625
Roughing the passer!

00:25:33.833 --> 00:25:34.500
Oh fun!

00:25:34.500 --> 00:25:35.583
A new setback!

00:25:35.583 --> 00:25:36.583
I am Lamar!

00:25:36.583 --> 00:25:37.083
I am…

00:25:37.333 --> 00:25:37.833
AH, FLUFF-

00:25:37.833 --> 00:25:39.333
Hell yeah, I get to disappear again!

00:25:39.333 --> 00:25:40.125
MR. BREES

00:25:40.125 --> 00:25:42.083
I DON’T FEEL SO GOOD.

00:25:42.083 --> 00:25:42.708
I blame the refs

00:25:42.708 --> 00:25:44.125
and I refuse to accept this reality.

00:25:44.250 --> 00:25:45.833
OK, so that’s one of the 14 million ways

00:25:45.833 --> 00:25:46.583
this could go down.

00:25:46.583 --> 00:25:47.458
Let’s practice it again!

00:25:47.458 --> 00:25:48.208
Ugh.

00:25:48.583 --> 00:25:50.000
Thanos didn’t go far enough.

